<Folder><name>Group 1</name>
<Placemark><name>G1 START</name><description>Junction of Tha Taphao Rd (ถ.ท่าตะเภา) &amp; Poramin Mankha Rd (ถ.ปรมินทรมรรคา)</description><Point><coordinates>99.17388,10.49595,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G1 step 1: Poramin Mankha Rd</name><description>Start here. Head south-east along Poramin Mankha Rd (ถ.ปรมินทรมรรคา) for about 240 m to the junction with Sala Daeng Rd (ถ.ศาลาแดง).</description><styleUrl>#g1film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17388,10.49595,0 99.17421,10.49581,0 99.17586,10.49509,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G1 step 2: Poowanaad Damnurn Rd</name><description>Turn right onto Poowanaad Damnurn Rd (ถ.ภูนารถดำเนิน), heading south for about 120 m, passing Rajaviteeklang Rd (ถ.ราษฎร์วิถีกลาง), to the junction with Rajaveetnai Rd.</description><styleUrl>#g1film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17586,10.49509,0 99.1757,10.49436,0 99.17565,10.49415,0 99.17563,10.49406,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G1 step 3: Poowanaad Damnurn Rd (connect only)</name><description>Continue straight and walk along Poowanaad Damnurn Rd (ถ.ภูนารถดำเนิน), heading south for about 90 m to where it meets Riverside walkway around the U-bend (inner bank) (ทางเดินริมแม่น้ำท่าตะเภา (ด้านในโค้ง)). [Connecting walk - no filming needed]</description><styleUrl>#g1con</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17563,10.49406,0 99.17554,10.49359,0 99.17552,10.49344,0 99.17555,10.49326,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G1 step 4: Riverside walkway around the U-bend (inner bank)</name><description>Bear right onto Riverside walkway around the U-bend (inner bank) (ทางเดินริมแม่น้ำท่าตะเภา (ด้านในโค้ง)), heading south-west for about 450 m to where it meets Rajaviteeklang Rd (ถ.ราษฎร์วิถีกลาง). [Not in Google Maps: walk the riverside path on the inner bank of the bend, keeping the river on your left/right side as shown on the map]</description><styleUrl>#g1film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17555,10.49326,0 99.17534,10.493,0 99.17489,10.49292,0 99.17461,10.49298,0 99.17423,10.49319,0 99.17405,10.49351,0 99.17391,10.49399,0 99.17368,10.49454,0 99.17328,10.49505,0 99.17321,10.49551,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G1 step 5: Rajaviteeklang Rd</name><description>Turn sharp right onto Rajaviteeklang Rd (ถ.ราษฎร์วิถีกลาง), heading south-east for about 430 m, passing Poowanaad Damnurn Rd (ถ.ภูนารถดำเนิน), to where it meets Jindasatee Alley.</description><styleUrl>#g1film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17321,10.49551,0 99.17357,10.49522,0 99.17383,10.49505,0 99.17427,10.49481,0 99.17469,10.49464,0 99.17486,10.49457,0 99.1757,10.49436,0 99.17608,10.49428,0 99.17621,10.49424,0 99.17632,10.4942,0 99.17676,10.49402,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G1 step 6: Jindasatee Alley</name><description>Turn left onto Jindasatee Alley, heading north-east for about 60 m to the finish point.</description><styleUrl>#g1film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17676,10.49402,0 99.17701,10.49447,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G1 FINISH</name><description>Junction of Poramin Mankha Rd (ถ.ปรมินทรมรรคา) &amp; Jindasatee Alley</description><Point><coordinates>99.17701,10.49447,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder>
<Folder><name>Group 2</name>
<Placemark><name>G2 START</name><description>West end of Rajaveetnai Rd (ถ.ราษฎร์วิถีใน)</description><Point><coordinates>99.1741,10.49417,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G2 step 1: Rajaveetnai Rd (optional)</name><description>Start here. Head east along Rajaveetnai Rd for about 170 m to where it meets Poowanaad Damnurn Rd (ถ.ภูนารถดำเนิน). [Optional / blue - film if time allows]</description><styleUrl>#g2opt</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.1741,10.49417,0 99.17434,10.49413,0 99.17468,10.4941,0 99.17476,10.49409,0 99.17494,10.49409,0 99.17512,10.49408,0 99.1754,10.49408,0 99.17563,10.49406,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G2 step 2: Poowanaad Damnurn Rd</name><description>Turn right onto Poowanaad Damnurn Rd (ถ.ภูนารถดำเนิน), heading south for about 90 m to where it meets Riverside walkway along the Tha Taphao River (ทางเดินริมแม่น้ำท่าตะเภา).</description><styleUrl>#g2film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17563,10.49406,0 99.17554,10.49359,0 99.17552,10.49344,0 99.17555,10.49326,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G2 step 3: Riverside walkway along the Tha Taphao River</name><description>Turn left onto Riverside walkway along the Tha Taphao River (ทางเดินริมแม่น้ำท่าตะเภา), heading east for about 700 m to where it meets East riverbank south of Hwy 327 (check on site first) (ริมตลิ่งฝั่งตะวันออก ใต้ทางหลวง 327). [Mostly not in Google Maps: the first ~420 m hugs the north bank (follow the riverside path on foot); the last ~270 m is the east-bank road down to Hwy 327, which Google does show]</description><styleUrl>#g2film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17555,10.49326,0 99.17594,10.49324,0 99.1771,10.49389,0 99.17737,10.49389,0 99.17754,10.49382,0 99.17783,10.49361,0 99.17795,10.4934,0 99.17814,10.49235,0 99.1786,10.49191,0 99.17889,10.49149,0 99.1793,10.49118,0 99.17938,10.491,0 99.17936,10.49038,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G2 step 4: East riverbank south of Hwy 327 (check on site first) (optional)</name><description>Continue straight onto East riverbank south of Hwy 327 (check on site first) (ริมตลิ่งฝั่งตะวันออก ใต้ทางหลวง 327), heading south for about 460 m to the next junction. [Optional / blue - film if time allows] [Optional and NOT in Google Maps or OpenStreetMap: check on site first that the east riverbank is walkable; skip it if not]</description><styleUrl>#g2opt</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17936,10.49038,0 99.17976,10.48933,0 99.17983,10.48923,0 99.18081,10.48883,0 99.18156,10.48867,0 99.18206,10.48838,0 99.18222,10.48817,0 99.18221,10.48793,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G2 step 5: East riverbank south of Hwy 327 (check on site first) (optional)</name><description>Bear right to stay on East riverbank south of Hwy 327 (check on site first) (ริมตลิ่งฝั่งตะวันออก ใต้ทางหลวง 327), heading south-west for about 270 m to the finish point. [Optional / blue - film if time allows] [Optional and NOT in Google Maps or OpenStreetMap: check on site first that the east riverbank is walkable; skip it if not]</description><styleUrl>#g2opt</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18221,10.48793,0 99.18198,10.48741,0 99.18162,10.4869,0 99.18121,10.48647,0 99.18098,10.48609,0 99.18075,10.48597,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G2 FINISH</name><description>End of the east-riverbank stretch, about 700 m south of the Hwy 327 river bridge</description><Point><coordinates>99.18075,10.48597,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder>
<Folder><name>Group 3</name>
<Placemark><name>G3 START</name><description>Junction of Soi Saladaeng 1 &amp; Sala Daeng Rd (ถ.ศาลาแดง)</description><Point><coordinates>99.17634,10.49701,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G3 step 1: Soi Saladaeng 1</name><description>Start here. Head west along Soi Saladaeng 1 for about 230 m to where it meets Tha Taphao Rd (ถ.ท่าตะเภา).</description><styleUrl>#g3film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17634,10.49701,0 99.17535,10.49719,0 99.17528,10.49718,0 99.1752,10.49713,0 99.17514,10.49703,0 99.17508,10.497,0 99.17488,10.49707,0 99.17465,10.49714,0 99.17436,10.49723,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G3 step 2: Tha Taphao Rd</name><description>Turn left onto Tha Taphao Rd (ถ.ท่าตะเภา), heading south for about 150 m to where it meets Poramin Mankha Rd (ถ.ปรมินทรมรรคา).</description><styleUrl>#g3film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17436,10.49723,0 99.17435,10.49718,0 99.17415,10.49667,0 99.17408,10.49648,0 99.17388,10.49595,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G3 step 3: Poramin Mankha Rd</name><description>Turn right onto Poramin Mankha Rd (ถ.ปรมินทรมรรคา), heading north-west for about 400 m, passing Rajaviteeklang Rd (ถ.ราษฎร์วิถีกลาง), Soi Poraminmanka 1 (ซอยปรมินทรมรรคา 1), to the junction with Nawamin Ruam Chai Rd (ถ.นวมินทร์ร่วมใจ).</description><styleUrl>#g3film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17388,10.49595,0 99.17373,10.49602,0 99.17296,10.49644,0 99.17258,10.49666,0 99.17249,10.49671,0 99.17245,10.49673,0 99.17226,10.49685,0 99.17217,10.4969,0 99.17172,10.49715,0 99.17142,10.49733,0 99.17117,10.49747,0 99.17085,10.49763,0 99.17073,10.49769,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G3 step 4: Nawamin Ruam Chai Rd (bridge approach) (optional)</name><description>Turn left onto Nawamin Ruam Chai Rd (bridge approach) (ถ.นวมินทร์ร่วมใจ), heading south-west for about 100 m to where it meets Riverside road along the Tha Taphao River (ถนนเลียบแม่น้ำท่าตะเภา). [Optional / blue - film if time allows] [Google Maps may send you across the bridge here: instead take the short link from the end of Poramin Mankha Rd down to the riverside road, as drawn on the map]</description><styleUrl>#g3opt</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17073,10.49769,0 99.17044,10.49743,0 99.17028,10.49724,0 99.17041,10.497,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G3 step 5: Riverside road along the Tha Taphao River</name><description>Continue straight onto Riverside road along the Tha Taphao River (ถนนเลียบแม่น้ำท่าตะเภา), heading south-east for about 350 m to where it meets Rajaviteeklang Rd (ถ.ราษฎร์วิถีกลาง).</description><styleUrl>#g3film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17041,10.497,0 99.17066,10.49667,0 99.17078,10.49654,0 99.17087,10.49647,0 99.17127,10.49621,0 99.17162,10.49603,0 99.172,10.49589,0 99.17235,10.49579,0 99.17279,10.49567,0 99.17288,10.49562,0 99.17303,10.49552,0 99.17313,10.4956,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G3 step 6: Rajaviteeklang Rd</name><description>Turn sharp left onto Rajaviteeklang Rd (ถ.ราษฎร์วิถีกลาง), heading north-west for about 170 m to the finish point.</description><styleUrl>#g3film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17313,10.4956,0 99.17321,10.49551,0 99.17313,10.4956,0 99.17311,10.49564,0 99.17305,10.49573,0 99.17272,10.49627,0 99.17264,10.49647,0 99.17258,10.49666,0 99.17249,10.49671,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G3 FINISH</name><description>Junction of Poramin Mankha Rd (ถ.ปรมินทรมรรคา) &amp; Rajaviteeklang Rd (ถ.ราษฎร์วิถีกลาง)</description><Point><coordinates>99.17249,10.49671,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder>
<Folder><name>Group 4</name>
<Placemark><name>G4 START</name><description>Junction of Prachauthid Rd (ถ.ประชาอุทิศ) &amp; Sala Daeng Rd (ถ.ศาลาแดง)</description><Point><coordinates>99.17672,10.49851,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G4 step 1: Sala Daeng Rd</name><description>Start here. Head north along Sala Daeng Rd (ถ.ศาลาแดง) for about 340 m, passing Soi Suksamur 9, Soi Saladaeng 6, to where it meets Krommaluang Chumphon Rd (ถ.กรมหลวงชุมพร).</description><styleUrl>#g4film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17672,10.49851,0 99.17691,10.49928,0 99.17704,10.49977,0 99.17711,10.50006,0 99.17746,10.50146,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G4 step 2: Krommaluang Chumphon Rd</name><description>Turn right onto Krommaluang Chumphon Rd (ถ.กรมหลวงชุมพร), heading east for about 650 m, passing Soi Krumluang Chumphon 1, Soi Suksamur 4, to where it meets Soi Pisist Payabal 3.</description><styleUrl>#g4film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17746,10.50146,0 99.17754,10.50146,0 99.17837,10.50129,0 99.17862,10.50124,0 99.17883,10.5012,0 99.17897,10.50117,0 99.17921,10.50112,0 99.17933,10.50109,0 99.17964,10.50103,0 99.17975,10.50101,0 99.17996,10.50096,0 99.1804,10.50087,0 99.18048,10.50086,0 99.18111,10.50072,0 99.1813,10.50069,0 99.18145,10.50065,0 99.18161,10.50062,0 99.18232,10.50047,0 99.18283,10.50037,0 99.18329,10.50027,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G4 step 3: Soi Pisist Payabal 3 (optional)</name><description>Turn right onto Soi Pisist Payabal 3, heading south for about 490 m, passing Soi Pisist Payabal 3/5, Soi Pisist Payabal 3/4, Soi Pisist Payabal 3/3, Soi Pisist Payabal 3/2, Soi Pisist Payabal 3/1, to the finish point. [Optional / blue - film if time allows]</description><styleUrl>#g4opt</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18329,10.50027,0 99.18318,10.49972,0 99.18314,10.49946,0 99.18315,10.49902,0 99.18316,10.499,0 99.18317,10.49857,0 99.18318,10.49815,0 99.18317,10.49766,0 99.18318,10.49735,0 99.1832,10.49636,0 99.18322,10.49583,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G4 FINISH</name><description>Junction of Prachauthid Rd (ถ.ประชาอุทิศ) &amp; Soi Pisist Payabal 3</description><Point><coordinates>99.18322,10.49583,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Folder>
<Folder><name>Group 5</name>
<Placemark><name>G5 START</name><description>Junction of Poramin Mankha Rd (ถ.ปรมินทรมรรคา) &amp; Pinij Kadee Rd</description><Point><coordinates>99.17912,10.49344,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G5 step 1: Pinij Kadee Rd</name><description>Start here. Head north-east along Pinij Kadee Rd for about 170 m, passing Poramin Mankha Rd (ถ.ปรมินทรมรรคา), to where it meets Prachauthid Rd (ถ.ประชาอุทิศ).</description><styleUrl>#g5film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17912,10.49344,0 99.17894,10.49353,0 99.17914,10.49396,0 99.17923,10.49414,0 99.17949,10.49472,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G5 step 2: Prachauthid Rd</name><description>Bear right onto Prachauthid Rd (ถ.ประชาอุทิศ), heading east for about 180 m, passing Phisit Phayaban Rd, to the junction with Suksamur Rd (ถ.สุขเสมอ).</description><styleUrl>#g5film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17949,10.49472,0 99.17962,10.49474,0 99.1801,10.49484,0 99.18019,10.49485,0 99.18098,10.49505,0 99.18108,10.49508,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G5 step 3: Phisit Phayaban Rd</name><description>Turn sharp right onto Phisit Phayaban Rd, heading south-west for about 260 m, passing Prachauthid Rd (ถ.ประชาอุทิศ), to where it meets Poramin Mankha Rd (ถ.ปรมินทรมรรคา).</description><styleUrl>#g5film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18108,10.49508,0 99.18098,10.49505,0 99.18096,10.49493,0 99.18093,10.49485,0 99.18053,10.49414,0 99.18039,10.49389,0 99.18015,10.49345,0 99.18003,10.49322,0 99.17993,10.49305,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G5 step 4: Poramin Mankha Rd</name><description>Turn left onto Poramin Mankha Rd (ถ.ปรมินทรมรรคา), heading south-east for about 410 m to the junction with Hwy 327 (Mueang Chumphon Rd) (ถ.เมืองชุมพร).</description><styleUrl>#g5film</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.17993,10.49305,0 99.18028,10.49288,0 99.18044,10.4928,0 99.1806,10.49271,0 99.18106,10.49249,0 99.18125,10.49239,0 99.18129,10.49237,0 99.18139,10.49232,0 99.18182,10.49213,0 99.18201,10.49204,0 99.18217,10.49197,0 99.18292,10.49163,0 99.18319,10.49151,0 99.18333,10.49145,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G5 step 5: Soi linking Poramin Mankha Rd and Saha Korn Rd (optional)</name><description>Turn left onto Soi linking Poramin Mankha Rd and Saha Korn Rd (ซอยเชื่อม ถ.ปรมินทรมรรคา–ถ.สหกรณ์), heading north for about 180 m to the next junction. [Optional / blue - film if time allows]</description><styleUrl>#g5opt</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>99.18333,10.49145,0 99.18334,10.49158,0 99.1835,10.49252,0 99.18357,10.49282,0 99.1838,10.49287,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
